bool LocalCandidatePage::actionAllowed(const QWidget* origin)const{return isVisible()&&isEnabled()&&!window()->isMinimized()&&QGuiApplication::applicationState()==Qt::ApplicationActive&&(!origin||(origin->isVisible()&&origin->isEnabled()));}
bool LocalCandidatePage::callbackAllowed()const{auto source=sender();return !source||actionAllowed(qobject_cast<QWidget*>(source));}
LocalCandidatePage::~LocalCandidatePage(){cancel();workers.waitForDone();}
void LocalCandidatePage::cancel(){if(backgroundPicker){backgroundPicker->hide();backgroundPicker->deleteLater();backgroundPicker=nullptr;for(auto widget:findChildren<QWidget*>(QString(),Qt::FindDirectChildrenOnly)){auto was=widget->property("candidateBeforePaneVisible");if(was.isValid()){widget->setVisible(was.toBool());widget->setProperty("candidateBeforePaneVisible",QVariant());}}}cancelled->store(true);++generation;workers.clear();busy=false;deleteId.clear();if(deleteButton)deleteButton->setText("删除当前已打开历史");controls();}
void LocalCandidatePage::run(std::function<QJsonObject(const localCandidate::Cancel&)> work,std::function<void(QJsonObject)> done,const QString& message){
 cancel();busy=true;cancelled=std::make_shared<std::atomic_bool>(false);auto flag=cancelled;auto token=generation;auto hook=hooks.beforeWork;QPointer<LocalCandidatePage> self(this);state->setText(message);controls();
 workers.start(QRunnable::create([flag,token,hook,self,work=std::move(work),done=std::move(done)]{QJsonObject out;QString error;localCandidate::Cancel c=[flag]{return flag->load();};try{if(hook)hook(c);if(c())return;out=work(c);}catch(const std::exception& e){error=QString::fromUtf8(e.what());}QMetaObject::invokeMethod(qApp,[self,flag,token,out,error,done]{if(!self||flag->load()||token!=self->generation)return;self->busy=false;self->controls();if(!error.isEmpty()){self->state->setText(error);return;}done(out);},Qt::QueuedConnection);}));
}
void LocalCandidatePage::invalidate(){cancel();backgroundBundle={};backgroundDigest.clear();result={};namedId.clear();draftHash.clear();renderResult();state->setText("选择或模板已改变，请重新显式计算；旧历史未改动。");}
void LocalCandidatePage::controls(){if(!calculateButton)return;calculateButton->setEnabled(!busy&&!selected.isEmpty()&&selected.size()<=50);cancelButton->setEnabled(busy);saveButton->setEnabled(!busy&&!result.isEmpty());exportButton->setEnabled(!busy&&!result.isEmpty());deleteButton->setEnabled(!busy&&!namedId.isEmpty());openButton->setEnabled(!busy&&table->currentRow()>=0);if(auto reader=findChild<QPushButton*>("candidateReadFull"))reader->setEnabled(!busy&&!result.isEmpty()&&table->currentRow()>=0);count->setText(QString("已选 %1 / 50 · 自选 %2").arg(selected.size()).arg(roster.size()));}
void LocalCandidatePage::refreshRoster(){if(!callbackAllowed())return;invalidate();try{require(bool(host.existingData),"未接入现有自选数据");auto values=host.existingData();require(values.size()<=3000,"自选范围超过3000条，请先整理；未截取");QJsonArray out;QSet<QString> ids;QStringList groups;for(auto v:values){auto s=v.toObject();auto id=s["id"].toString();if(s["transient"].toBool()||!QRegularExpression("^(SH|SZ|BJ):stock:[0-9]{6}$").match(id).hasMatch())continue;require(!ids.contains(id),"自选完整身份重复，请先检查数据");ids.insert(id);out.append(s);auto g=s["group"].toString();if(!groups.contains(g))groups.append(g);}roster=out;selected.intersect(ids);{QSignalBlocker block(group);group->clear();group->addItem("全部实际自选",QVariant());for(auto g:groups)group->addItem(g.isEmpty()?"未分组":g,g);}renderScope();state->setText(QString("已读取本机实际自选 %1 只；未获取网络行情。").arg(roster.size()));}catch(const std::exception& e){roster={};selected.clear();renderScope();state->setText(QString::fromUtf8(e.what()));}}
void LocalCandidatePage::renderScope(){rendering=true;scope->setRowCount(0);auto query=search->text().trimmed();for(auto v:roster){auto s=v.toObject();if(group->currentIndex()>0&&s["group"].toString()!=group->currentData().toString())continue;if(!(s["name"].toString()+" "+s["id"].toString()).contains(query,Qt::CaseInsensitive))continue;int i=scope->rowCount();scope->insertRow(i);auto check=new QTableWidgetItem;check->setFlags(Qt::ItemIsEnabled|Qt::ItemIsSelectable|Qt::ItemIsUserCheckable);check->setData(Qt::UserRole,s["id"].toString());check->setCheckState(selected.contains(s["id"].toString())?Qt::Checked:Qt::Unchecked);scope->setItem(i,0,check);scope->setItem(i,1,new QTableWidgetItem(s["name"].toString()));scope->setItem(i,2,new QTableWidgetItem(s["id"].toString()));for(int col=1;col<3;col++)scope->item(i,col)->setToolTip(s["name"].toString()+"\n"+s["id"].toString()+"\n"+s["group"].toString());}rendering=false;controls();}
void LocalCandidatePage::calculate(){if(!callbackAllowed()||busy)return;if(backgroundMode->currentIndex()==1){calculateBackground();return;}try{require(bool(host.snapshot),"未接入现有日K快照");auto inputs=host.snapshot(selected);QSet<QString> returned;for(auto v:inputs)returned.insert(v.toObject()["id"].toString());require(returned==selected&&inputs.size()==selected.size(),"部分所选证券不在当前本机数据中；未静默截取或替换");auto at=hooks.now?hooks.now():QDateTime::currentDateTimeUtc();auto frozen=localCandidate::snapshot(inputs,localCandidate::strategies.value(strategy->currentIndex()),at);result={};namedId.clear();draftHash.clear();renderResult();auto path=file;run([path,frozen](const auto& c){auto r=localCandidate::evaluate(frozen,c);auto anchor=localCandidate::Store(path).putDraft(r,c);return QJsonObject{{"result",r},{"anchor",anchor}};},[this](auto out){result=out["result"].toObject();draftHash=out["anchor"].toString();renderResult();state->setText(QString("计算完成 %1 只 · 输入已冻结 / %2；非实时保证、非买卖建议。").arg(result.value("rows").toArray().size()).arg(result.value("input").toObject()["capturedAt"].toString()));},"正在计算并保存本机冻结草稿…");}catch(const std::exception& e){state->setText(QString::fromUtf8(e.what()));}}
void LocalCandidatePage::renderResult(){auto frozen=result.value("input").toObject();auto index=localCandidate::strategies.indexOf(frozen["strategy"].toString());resultCaption->setText(result.isEmpty()?"尚无冻结结果":QString("冻结结果 · %1 · %2").arg(localCandidate::labels.value(index),frozen["capturedAt"].toString()));QSignalBlocker blocked(table);table->setRowCount(0);QList<QJsonObject> rows;for(auto v:result.value("rows").toArray()){auto r=v.toObject();if(!onlyExcluded->isChecked()||r["status"].toString()=="excluded")rows.append(r);}std::sort(rows.begin(),rows.end(),[this](auto a,auto b){if(sort->currentIndex()==1)return a["id"].toString()<b["id"].toString();if(sort->currentIndex()==2&&a["missing"].toArray().size()!=b["missing"].toArray().size())return a["missing"].toArray().size()<b["missing"].toArray().size();auto as=a["score"].isDouble()?a["score"].toInt():-1,bs=b["score"].isDouble()?b["score"].toInt():-1;return as==bs?a["id"].toString()<b["id"].toString():as>bs;});for(auto r:rows){int i=table->rowCount();table->insertRow(i);QStringList cells{r["score"].isNull()?"—":QString::number(r["score"].toInt()),statusName(r["status"].toString()),r["name"].toString()+" · "+r["id"].toString(),QString::number(r["barCount"].toInt()),r["dataDate"].toString(),QString::number(r["missing"].toArray().size())};for(int j=0;j<cells.size();j++){auto item=new QTableWidgetItem(cells[j]);item->setToolTip(cells[j]);table->setItem(i,j,item);}table->item(i,0)->setData(Qt::UserRole,r["id"].toString());}explanation->clear();controls();}
void LocalCandidatePage::detail(){controls();int index=table->currentRow();if(index<0)return;auto id=table->item(index,0)->data(Qt::UserRole).toString();for(auto v:result.value("rows").toArray()){auto r=v.toObject();if(r["id"].toString()!=id)continue;auto source=r["source"].toObject(),meta=source["dayMeta"].toObject(),q=source["quote"].toObject();QStringList lines{r["name"].toString()+" · "+id+" · "+statusName(r["status"].toString()),QString("原始贡献合计 %1 → 0–100限制后 %2").arg(r["rawScore"].isNull()?"未评分":QString::number(r["rawScore"].toInt()),r["score"].isNull()?"未评分":QString::number(r["score"].toInt())),""};for(auto c:r["contributions"].toArray()){auto contribution=c.toObject();lines<<QString("%1%2  %3").arg(contribution["points"].toInt()>=0?"+":"").arg(contribution["points"].toInt()).arg(contribution["label"].toString());}lines<<""<<"因子（缺数不是0）";auto f=r["factors"].toObject();for(auto key:f.keys())lines<<key+": "+(f[key].isNull()?"不可用":QString::number(f[key].toDouble(),'g',12));lines<<""<<"缺失 / 排除原因"<<joined(r["missing"].toArray())<<""<<"来源与时间"<<("日K "+meta["source"].toString()+" / "+meta["dataDate"].toString()+" / "+meta["adjustment"].toString()+" / "+meta["volumeUnit"].toString())<<("日K检查 "+meta["checkedAt"].toString()+" / 缓存 "+(meta["cached"].toBool()?"是":"否或未标"))<<("报价 "+q["source"].toString()+" / "+q["tradeDate"].toString()+" "+q["tradeTime"].toString())<<("报价检查 "+q["checkedAt"].toString())<<""<<joined(r["risks"].toArray())<<r["background"].toString();if(!backgroundBundle.isEmpty())for(auto diagnostic:backgroundBundle["adapter"].toObject()["backgrounds"].toObject()[id].toObject()["adapterDiagnostics"].toArray())lines<<diagnostic.toString();if(!backgroundBundle.isEmpty()){auto raw=backgroundBundle["adapter"].toObject()["input"].toObject();if(raw["schema"]=="native-candidate-background-sources/v2-business-demand")lines<<candidateBusiness::describe(raw["businessSelection"].toObject());if(raw.contains("themeSelection"))lines<<candidateTheme::describe(raw["themeSelection"].toObject());lines<<"完整冻结背景与计算证据："<<QString::fromUtf8(QJsonDocument(backgroundBundle).toJson(QJsonDocument::Indented));}explanation->setPlainText(lines.join("\n"));break;}}
void LocalCandidatePage::save(){if(!callbackAllowed()||busy||result.isEmpty())return;auto frozen=result;auto name=title->text();auto path=file;auto bridge=host.background;auto bundle=backgroundBundle;try{auto held=bundle["adapter"].toObject()["input"].toObject()["themeSelection"].toObject();if(!held.isEmpty()){QSet<QString> ids;for(auto v:held["securities"].toArray())ids.insert(v.toObject()["id"].toString());require(localCandidate::canonical(host.snapshot(ids))==localCandidate::canonical(held["securities"]),"保存前证券版本已变化；旧证据保留，请重新预览");}}catch(const std::exception&e){state->setText(QString::fromUtf8(e.what()));return;}run([path,frozen,name,bridge,bundle](const auto& c){auto id=bundle.isEmpty()?localCandidate::Store(path).save(name,frozen,QDateTime::currentDateTimeUtc(),c):bridge->save(name,bundle,QDateTime::currentDateTimeUtc(),c);return QJsonObject{{"id",id},{"backgroundDigest",bundle.isEmpty()?QString():localCandidateBackgroundAdapter::sourceDigest(bundle)}};},[this](auto out){namedId=out["id"].toString();backgroundDigest=out["backgroundDigest"].toString();listHistory();},"正在保存冻结结果并读回核验…");}
void LocalCandidatePage::listHistory(){if(!callbackAllowed())return;auto path=file;auto bridge=backgroundMode->currentIndex()==1?host.background:nullptr;run([path,bridge](const auto& c){return QJsonObject{{"rows",bridge?bridge->list(c):localCandidate::Store(path).list(c)}};},[this](auto out){historyRows=out["rows"].toArray();history->setRowCount(0);for(auto v:historyRows){auto r=v.toObject();int i=history->rowCount();history->insertRow(i);history->setItem(i,0,new QTableWidgetItem(r["title"].toString()));history->item(i,0)->setData(Qt::UserRole,r["id"].toString());history->setItem(i,1,new QTableWidgetItem(r["savedAt"].toString()));}state->setText(QString("历史 %1 份 · 当前结果%2；历史不会随行情更新。").arg(historyRows.size()).arg(namedId.isEmpty()?"尚未命名保存":"已保存"));controls();},"正在读取本机候选历史…");}
void LocalCandidatePage::loadHistory(){if(!callbackAllowed()||busy||history->currentRow()<0)return;auto id=history->item(history->currentRow(),0)->data(Qt::UserRole).toString(),path=file;result={};backgroundBundle={};backgroundDigest.clear();namedId.clear();draftHash.clear();renderResult();auto bridge=backgroundMode->currentIndex()==1?host.background:nullptr;run([id,path,bridge](const auto& c){if(!bridge)return localCandidate::Store(path).read(id,c);auto out=bridge->read(id,c);out["result"]=out["bundle"].toObject()["result"];return out;},[this](auto out){result=out["result"].toObject();backgroundBundle=out["bundle"].toObject();backgroundDigest=out["digest"].toString();namedId=out["id"].toString();title->setText(out["title"].toString());renderResult();state->setText("已打开冻结历史，不重新抓取或计算；来源日期见每项解释。");},"正在读取选中历史；读取成功前不可删除其它结果…");}
void LocalCandidatePage::removeHistory(){if(!callbackAllowed()||busy||namedId.isEmpty())return;if(deleteId!=namedId){deleteId=namedId;deleteButton->setText("再点确认删除这份已打开历史");return;}auto id=namedId,path=file;auto bridge=backgroundBundle.isEmpty()?nullptr:host.background;auto expected=backgroundDigest;run([path,id,bridge,expected](const auto& c){if(bridge)bridge->remove(id,expected,c);else localCandidate::Store(path).remove(id,c);return QJsonObject{};},[this](auto){namedId.clear();result={};backgroundBundle={};backgroundDigest.clear();draftHash.clear();renderResult();listHistory();},"正在删除明确确认的历史；其它记录保留…");}
