bool LocalCandidatePage::eventFilter(QObject* watched,QEvent* event){if(watched==table->viewport()&&event->type()==QEvent::Resize){auto header=table->horizontalHeader();auto mode=table->viewport()->width()<620?QHeaderView::Interactive:QHeaderView::Stretch;if(header->sectionResizeMode(2)!=mode)header->setSectionResizeMode(2,mode);if(mode==QHeaderView::Interactive&&table->columnWidth(2)<220)table->setColumnWidth(2,220);}return QWidget::eventFilter(watched,event);}

